  "text": "Special\nOffers\n\nNeed a closer look? Buy a sample\nColor\n\nKeystone\nCharcoal Base with Burgundy and Beige Tones\n\nKeystone Inside Corner\n18\" x 22.5\" or 2.81 SQFT\n\nHome Faux Stone Panels Keystone Keystone Inside Corner\nThe 90° inside corner piece is unique to the GenStone system. This panel eliminates the need to miter panels when you need to transition through an inside corner. Like the outside corner panel, this piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge runs along the left side of the panel and the negative shiplap edge follows the right side. Each shiplap is designed to provide a tight connection to panels joined to its right and left.\n\n$ 64.99 each\n\n- Keystone Inside Corner quantity +\nAdd to cart\n\nCalculator Project SOS\n\n+51 pictures\n\nGet everything you need\n\nGuides & Downloads\n\nReviews\nProduct Knowledge\nSpecs\n\nThe 90° inside corner piece is unique to the GenStone system. This panel eliminates the need to miter panels when you need to transition through an inside corner. Like the outside corner panel, this piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge runs along the left side of the panel and the negative shiplap edge follows the right side. Each shiplap is designed to provide a tight connection to panels joined to its right and left.",
